                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "IMHO balance doesn't exist. On the ground PHC has been OP for years now (just look at the artillery), and yet every single \"balance\" pass keeps buffing them and/or nerfs Substrate even more. In the air, Substrate can have advantage, but it only really happens in the late game and can be countered a lot easier, than the situation on the ground.\r\nStory is OK - nothing ground breaking, but not bad either. Used to be fun to replay every now and then, but not with current balance issues.\r\nWorks on Linux (Ubuntu + KDE) without any obvious issues. although I only play single player.",
